THIRD-PARTY NOTICES
===================

Simetra is licensed under Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE). This file lists source code
copied into this repository from other open-source projects, together with the
copyright and licence notices those projects require.

It covers copied code only. Ordinary package dependencies installed from npm
are not listed here; their notices ship with the packages themselves.

The rules for copying code (allowed licences, the per-file header,
clean-room policy) are in CONTRIBUTING.md.

Entry format
------------

An entry is added in the same change as the first file copied from a source,
and extended when more files are copied from it. One entry per source:

  Name:          <project name>
  Source:        <repository URL>
  License:       <SPDX identifier, as stated in the source's LICENSE file>
  Copyright:     <copyright line exactly as in the source>
  Files:         <paths in this repository that contain the copied code>
  Modifications: <what was changed, or "none">
  NOTICE:        <contents of the source's NOTICE file, when the source is
                 Apache-2.0 and ships one; otherwise omit>

  <full licence text of the source, reproduced for every allowed licence
  (MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD, ISC, PostgreSQL License)>

